SUMMARY:The Bromantics at New City Brewery
DESCRIPTION:Porchfest Party Time!!! We're having a fundraiser show to help raise funding for this year's Porchfest. Local bands The Bromantics\, Reuben Toadstool\, No No Knows (a tribute to the Yeah Yeah Yeahs)\, Vimana\, and Orange & Amber will all be playing! All proceeds from this show will go to supporting this year's Easthampton Porchfest (taking place on 10/3). Come out for a fun night of music\, dance\, beer and food! RSVP on Facebook
LOCATION:New City Brewery\, 180 Pleasant St\, Easthampton\, MA
URL:https://bromantics.band
END:VEVENT
